                            <img id="user-avatar-nav" src="https://via.placeholder.com/40" class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full object-cover border border-kemenag-gold hidden shrink-0" alt="Foto">
                            <span id="user-info" class="text-[10.5px] sm:text-xs font-extrabold text-kemenag-yellow truncate max-w-[110px] sm:max-w-[180px]"></span>
                            <span class="text-white/40 text-[10px]">•</span>
                            <span id="user-kua" class="text-[10px] text-emerald-200 font-semibold truncate max-w-[95px] sm:max-w-none"></span>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="keluarSistem()" class="text-[10px] bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-extrabold transition shadow flex items-center gap-1">
                            <i class="fas fa-power-off text-[9px]"></i> <span>Keluar</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div id="toast-push-notif-apk" class="hidden fixed top-24 right-4 left-4 sm:left-auto sm:w-96 bg-gradient-to-r from-kemenag-darkteal to-kemenag-teal text-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-2 border-kemenag-gold z-50 animate-bounce">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-kemenag-gold text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-lg shrink-0 shadow"><i class="fas fa-bell"></i></div>
                <div>
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase bg-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-kemenag-yellow">Pengingat Resmi Bimwin</span>
                    <h4 id="toast-judul-notif" class="font-extrabold text-sm mt-1">Pengingat Belajar Bimwin</h4>
                    <p id="toast-isi-notif" class="text-xs text-emerald-100 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed"></p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" onclick="document.getElementById('toast-push-notif-apk').classList.add('hidden')" class="text-white/80 hover:text-white"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 pt-2 border-t border-white/20 flex justify-end gap-2">
            <button type="button" onclick="bukaModalKotakMasukNotifAPK()" class="bg-kemenag-gold text-gray-900 font-extrabold px-3 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs shadow">Lihat Detail &amp; Konfirmasi</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="maintenance-overlay" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-kemenag-darkteal via-kemenag-teal to-emerald-900 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-6 text-white text-center">
        <div class="max-w-lg bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border-2 border-kemenag-gold rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-2xl space-y-4">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto rounded-full bg-kemenag-gold text-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center text-4xl shadow-lg"><i class="fas fa-tools"></i></div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-kemenag-yellow">Sistem Sedang Dalam Pemeliharaan Rutin</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-emerald-100 leading-relaxed">Sistem sedang dalam pemeliharaan rutin untuk peningkatan kualitas layanan Bimbingan Perkawinan Mandiri. Saat ini akses hanya dibuka untuk SuperAdmin Kemenag.</p>
            <div class="pt-3"><button type="button" onclick="bukaLoginDaruratAdmin()" class="bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-white/30"><i class="fas fa-user-shield mr-1"></i> Login Khusus SuperAdmin Kemenag</button></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="modal-fullscreen-verifikasi" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-kemenag-darkteal via-kemenag-teal to-emerald-950 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 w-full max-w-xl rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-kemenag-gold overflow-hidden my-auto">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-kemenag-darkteal to-kemenag-teal px-6 py-4 text-white flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-kemenag-gold">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full bg-white p-1 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                        <img src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgSFAkl-T9vjVO3h8hbEexC4Mg7kbSzGiBzrU5jbH9A_acXifuIcuoLuK-Neb7rhWk7bymCZ20R4rGM3R9dzoNAe7_Ahkm5tA6Hed7bL5KQ5Lxve1Ow1lgVKGWXf3MTBeMstf5IeSz0jUGYbkWKooqfToliNuEuZVkm6wDb3BaglVmKmJt37ujwYYrXFor_/s320/logo-kementerian-agama-kemenag-removebg-preview.png" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src=window.LOGO_KEMENAG_FALLBACK;" class="w-full h-full object-contain" alt="Logo">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 id="judul-header-fullscreen-verifikasi" class="font-black text-sm sm:text-base uppercase tracking-wider text-kemenag-yellow">Hasil Memeriksa Keabsahan</h3>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-emerald-100">Sistem Verifikasi Resmi Kementerian Agama RI</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="tutupModalFullscreenVerifikasi()" class="bg-white/15 hover:bg-red-500 text-white w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-lg transition"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
            </div>
            <div id="konten-fullscreen-verifikasi" class="p-6 space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm"></div>
            <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-900 border-t dark:border-gray-700 flex justify-end">
                <button type="button" onclick="tutupModalFullscreenVerifikasi()" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white font-extrabold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                    <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Keluar / Tutup Layar Pemeriksaan
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL SCAN QR PUBLIK (MENDUKUNG KAMERA LANGSUNG & FALLBACK UPLOAD GAMBAR DI GOOGLE SITES) -->
    <div id="modal-scan-qr-publik" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-80 hidden z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-3">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-kemenag-gold">
            <div class="bg-kemenag-teal px-5 py-3.5 text-white font-bold flex justify-between items-center border-b-2 border-kemenag-gold">
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-camera text-kemenag-gold"></i> Scan QR Keabsahan Dokumen</span>
                <button type="button" onclick="tutupModalScanQRPublik()" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white/15 hover:bg-red-500 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-center">
                <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-xs">Arahkan kamera ke QR Code pada Sertifikat, Piagam Kami Kompak, Portofolio, ID Card, atau pilih foto QR dari perangkat:</p>
                <div id="qr-reader-publik" class="w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-kemenag-teal bg-black min-h-[220px]"></div>
                <div class="pt-1">
                    <label class="w-full bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-gray-700 hover:bg-emerald-100 text-kemenag-teal dark:text-emerald-300 border border-kemenag-teal font-extrabold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer shadow-sm">
                        <i class="fas fa-image"></i> Pilih Foto / Tangkap Gambar QR dari HP
                        <input type="file" accept="image/*" capture="environment" onchange="scanFileGambarQRPublik(event)" class="hidden">
                    </label>
                </div>
                <button type="button" onclick="tutupModalScanQRPublik()" class="w-full bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700 font-bold py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs">Batal / Tutup Kamera</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main id="page-login" class="flex-grow p-3 sm:p-6 md:p-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full space-y-5">
        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 gap-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0">
                <button type="button" onclick="toggleHamburgerMenu('menu-utama-dropdown')" class="bg-kemenag-teal hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white w-9 h-9 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow transition shrink-0" title="Menu Beranda Utama">
                    <i class="fas fa-bars text-sm sm:text-base"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="min-w-0">
                    <span class="font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm text-kemenag-teal dark:text-emerald-400 block leading-tight">Menu Beranda Utama</span>
