                <div><strong>• Kadar Hemoglobin / Hb Darah (${hb} g/dL):</strong> ${risikoAnemia ? '<span class="text-red-600 font-bold">Di bawah 12 g/dL (Indikasi Anemia — Disarankan rutin minum Tablet Tambah Darah)</span>' : '<span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold">Normal &amp; Sehat (Minimal 12 g/dL terpenuhi)</span>'}</div>
